{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BONK THE BOYKISSER</strong> is a first-person survivors-like game focused on endless survival against advancing <strong>Boykissers</strong>, built around melee combat and progression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game places the player in combat with constantly advancing Boykissers while armed with a baseball bat. Defeating Boykissers grants experience and allows progression as the pressure steadily increases.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrades are not available by default and are unlocked by completing specific challenges during runs. Completing these challenges also grants <strong>Achievements</strong> that track progress and expand available options.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As time passes, the number of Boykissers grows and survival becomes increasingly difficult. Each run continues until the player can no longer hold out.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every attempt is recorded and compared with other players. New runs allow results to be improved and rankings to be climbed on the <strong>Leaderboard</strong>.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"MAX HP","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4119610/cb5c922b8365bb59262efde733097855e61b4a68.jpg"},{"name":"HP REGEN","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4119610/ca8e89f6d2a099a132c0d320f5e64bddfc8af594.jpg"},{"name":"EVASION","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4119610/bae75504d991f2552a988d395dac8f7ee0c316e8.jpg"},{"name":"ARMOR","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4119610/ad2dfa77619630abe0dff6877070f9862bd716e4.jpg"},{"name":"DAMAGE","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4119610/a6ebd1e2d49b02d5715db64e2ccbd7604eb8a3e4.jpg"},{"name":"ATTACK SPEED","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4119610/08370492700